     1123       apply "choose" to b-print in frame Dialog-Frame.
     1124   END.
     1125   ON choose OF MENU-ITEM m-one in menu m-print DO:
     1126       print-type = "one".
     1127       apply "choose" to b-print in frame Dialog-Frame.
