     1129   define variable vss-include-info11 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     1130   on help of frame Dialog-Frame
     1131   do:
     1132     run gbl/app_help.p
     1133       (input this-procedure :file-name
     1134       ,input ''
     1135       ,input ?
     1136       ) no-error.
     1137     if error-status :error then do:
     1138       message
     1139         "Ошибка при вызове помощи"
     1140         error-status :get-message(1)
     1141         view-as alert-box .
